      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I love this idea! Could make it easy to add working clocks/watches to avatars without the need for specialized shaders. \n\nSuggestions for format:\n\nTimeHours: int 0 - 24\n\nTimeHoursNormalized: float 0.0 - 1.0 for hours 0 - 24\n\nTimeMinutes: int 0 - 60 \n\nTimeMinutesNormalized: float 0.0 - 1.0 for minutes 0 - 60",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-11-24T07:42:33.961Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Now that we've a clock in-app, exposing parameters for the clock to use for avatars would be a neat addition and could possibly allow for cool time-related things people could do on their avatars.",
